  "metadata": {
    "title": "Tension-tension fatigue dataset for a non-crimp glass fiber fabric reinforced epoxy manufactured using three different cure-profiles",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15665325",
    "publication_date": "2025-06-15",
    "description": "<p>The data-set contains tension-tension fatigue test (and a few static tensile test) performed on test samples extracted from three different laminates cured following three different cure profiles</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EQA01: 40C in 20 h + 75C in 5 h</li>\n<li>EQA02: 75C in 3.3 h</li>\n<li>EQA03: 110C in 3.3 h</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The overall files</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EQA0x-StaticTestResults.xlsx:&nbsp; The static test overview for that case</li>\n<li>EQA0x-Testplan Fatigue R=01.xlsx: The fatigue test overview for that case</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Data-files</p>\n<ul>\n<li>xxx.sta.txt: The static tensile test data</li>\n<li>xxx.ten.txt: The initial upload (initial tensile test) performed before the fatigue test</li>\n<li>xxx.fat.txt: Values extracted from the individual fatigue test</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The EQA02 dataset has been used in the publication:</p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Morten Fogtmann Kristiansen, Steffen Rasmussen, Lars Pilgaard Mikkelsen, Transforming load controlled fatigue test data into a strain based SN-curve: Results for unidirectional non-crimp glass fiber/epoxy composites tested in tension-tension. <span>&nbsp;</span>45<sup>th</sup> Ris&oslash; Symposium, Sept. 1-4, 2025, Ris&oslash;, Denmark</span></p>",
    "access_right": "open",
    "creators": [
      {
        "name": "Mikkelsen, Lars Pilgaard",
        "affiliation": "Technical University of Denmark",
        "orcid": "0000-0002-6323-4395"
